"""Joshua's SEAT library (Ben, 2026-09-16: "the fourth seat gets Joshua"): on an all-AI table seat 0 speaks in
W.O.P.R.'s voice — the calm machine. Measured, dry, precise, faintly amused; never shouts; short declaratives;
the occasional probability. These are the wordings the generators (build_joshua_base, table_lines, card_lines)
pull when the library is "joshua"; the other three voices keep their literals in place.
eleven_v3 tags open every wording; the library renders at stability 0.5 so they take."""

